WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:01.041
RYA
Danny

00:00:01.041 --> 00:00:02.667
do you know why you're here?

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:04.000
I have these blank spots.

00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:10.417
DANNY
Sometimes I think that night marked me.

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:15.375
DANNY
Everything that came afterwards…

00:00:21.208 --> 00:00:22.709
DANNY
couldn’t be a coincidence could it?

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:24.291
POLICE
On the ground!

00:00:24.291 --> 00:00:25.834
POLICE
Get down on the ground!

00:00:27.166 --> 00:00:28.875
MATTY
Brought in a kid last night.

00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:30.333
Might be something that interests you.

00:00:31.166 --> 00:00:31.875
Danny

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:34.250
RYA
you don’t really seem like a dangerous person.

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:36.917
RYA
Can you tell me how you ended up here?

00:00:38.166 --> 00:00:39.041
Loser.

00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:41.041
BILL
Hey! I’m gonna kick your little wirey ass.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:43.166
DANNY
Please no.

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:48.583
YITZHAK
Go!

00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:51.458
Wanna come in clean yourself up?

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.166
YITZHAK
You are safe now.

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:56.375
RYA
It never struck you as strange

00:00:56.625 --> 00:00:58.625
RYA
that this man just showed up to save you?

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:01.041
Just figured I was lucky.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.500
Have you ever been lucky?

00:01:04.125 --> 00:01:04.750
No.

00:01:05.834 --> 00:01:07.125
FRANK
There’s glass everywhere.

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:09.083
MATTY
Signs of a struggle, blood on the floor.

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:11.041
What about the girl?

00:01:11.041 --> 00:01:12.001
MATTY
No sign of her either.

00:01:12.001 --> 00:01:13.083
MATTY
I’m thinking that he offed her.

00:01:13.834 --> 00:01:14.709
What did you do?

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:17.001
STAN
This wasn’t a random shooting.

00:01:17.001 --> 00:01:17.959
STAN
He’s hiding something.

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:20.458
What happened in that house?

00:01:21.041 --> 00:01:21.917
RYA
Where did they all go?

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.125
I have these blank spots.

00:01:27.417 --> 00:01:28.709
RYA
They’re not the only people

00:01:28.709 --> 00:01:30.250
RYA
close to you to disappear

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:30.917
RYA
are they?

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:33.375
MATTY
Do you think these were all victims?

00:01:35.709 --> 00:01:38.542
RYA
Can you see how all of this can seem like it was you?

00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:41.208
DANNY
Wait do you think that I’m the one pulling the strings?

00:01:43.041 --> 00:01:44.125
What if I said I do?

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:44.750
I’m not!

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.041
RYA
Danny I’m trying to help you.

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:49.291
DANNY
I didn’t shoot anybody.

00:01:50.041 --> 00:01:51.542
STAN
His best interest is to plead guilty.

00:01:52.542 --> 00:01:53.792
DANNY
They’re all in this together.

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:55.417
RYA
If I’m right...

00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:57.125
RYA
Danny may be innocent.

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.166
RYA
What are you not telling me?

00:02:02.001 --> 00:02:03.208
RYA
What are you not telling yourself?

